  "bodyHash": "154ca7da6c9ce5f4",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for Minecraft-1.19 | 1.16 | 1.14 | 1.12 | 1.11 | 1.9-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"524\" height=\"28\">&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client Only-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">《<strong>Better Animations Collection</strong>》旨在透過更改遊戲內模型來提供更流暢的動畫與細微特效，從而提升《Minecraft》的氛圍。它力求為適合的遊戲部分帶來更寫實的感覺，例如模擬物理效果，並讓原本不會移動的模型部件動起來。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 內容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>靈動鬼怪觸手</strong>：將地獄塔的觸手分為多個部分，讓它們像電影裡常見的觸手怪一樣真實擺動。讓它們看起來稍微有點嚇人，但整體視覺效果更好。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>流暢烏賊觸手</strong>：為烏賊的游泳動畫賦予水母般的漂浮效果。同時讓它們在移動時觸手更加隨水流飄動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>活潑狗狗</strong>：讓狼的尾巴變得更蓬鬆、飄逸，站立和奔跑時會真實地搖尾巴。被馴服的狼改為趴臥而非坐著。舉起肉塊時，它們還會翻滾撒嬌。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>飄逸豹貓尾巴</strong>：移除現行豹貓生硬的直尾巴，換成更漂亮的設計。擁有完整動畫的飄逸尾巴，站立或奔跑時會自然擺動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>捲曲貓尾巴</strong>：將豹貓引以为傲的美麗流動動畫尾巴也帶給家貓。不僅如此，它們坐下時尾巴還會自然地捲曲環繞身體！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>哼哧小豬</strong>：加入非常細微的動畫，讓豬在哼叫時鼻子會動。雖然只是輕輕上下微動，但確實存在。為你飼養的家畜增添一點生氣。別忘了還有飄動的耳朵！對這麼小的動物來說已經算很大了。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>搖晃奶牛乳房</strong>：讓奶牛在行走時乳房隨步伐晃動。同時也為它們添加了乳頭細節，如果你對此比較敏感，可以在設定中關閉此功能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>搖擺公雞</strong>：讓雞在咕咕叫時嘴巴開合。喙部也變得更加纖細，從此再也不用擔心把雞和鴨子搞混！當它們昂首闊步時，頭部會前後擺動，喉部的肉垂隨之搖晃，翅膀也會輕輕撲扇。完全還原現實！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>靈動村民鼻</strong>：進行細微調整，讓村民每次發出獨特的「嗯嗯」聲時，大鼻子都會跟著晃動！改變雖小，但誰能拒絕這份樂趣呢？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鐵傀儡靈動鼻</strong>：與上述功能完全相同，只是針對鐵傀儡！因為牠們不會發出聲音，所以在受傷時鼻子會隨之晃動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>液態史萊姆</strong>：帶來令人愉悅的視覺變化：讓史萊姆內部像液體一樣流動。跳躍時會溅出更多水花。眼睛、嘴巴以及核心本身都會獨立運動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>熔岩立方漢堡</strong>：為熔岩立方添加自訂死亡動畫，死亡時身體會變成一堆熱氣騰騰、美味可口的漢堡肉排。可惜你無法食用，因為它們實在太燙了。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>蜘蛛膝蓋</strong>：真正驚豔的視覺加成。蜘蛛現在終於擁有牠們一直夢寐以求的膝蓋了。同樣適用於洞穴蜘蛛。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>搖晃苦力怕</strong>：喚起大家對當年 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2rDbRUDkds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">超人氣音樂錄影帶</span></a> 的回憶，來自唯一真神 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCshoKvlZGZ20rVgazZp5vnQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">CaptainSparklez</span></a>。記得那個超級可愛的搖晃苦力怕嗎？現在它已加入遊戲了。完整版，原汁原味，跟影片裡一模一樣。可能是整個合集中最好的自訂動畫。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>揮舞手臂終界使者</strong>：憤怒的終界使者追逐目標時會瘋狂揮舞雙臂。非常符合牠們扭曲的性格：瘋狂揮舞的充氣長管終界使者！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>動態雪人手臂</strong>：雪人在丟雪球時，手臂會隨之擺動。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>跪姿綿羊</strong>：這設計相當巧妙。讓綿羊真的會彎下腰吃草。不再只是低下頭，而是整隻動物都降低高度，去品嚐那鮮嫩多汁的纖維。你有注意到牠們跪下時 KNEES（膝蓋）也會彎曲嗎？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>經典馬匹</strong>：讓馬匹重新變得更生動，就像舊版本那樣。透過恢復嘴巴和膝蓋的動畫，同時保持原版模型的風格來實現。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>吐唾沫羊駝</strong>：讓羊駝在吐口水時張開嘴巴。牠們以前是怎麼做到的啊？！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>類人生物膝蓋</strong>：讓殭屍類以及豬布林類的怪物在行走時膝蓋能夠彎曲。動作看起來非常流暢好看。你一定會喜歡，相信我。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 媒體：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/889/2021-07-29_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/376/50/2021-06-30_14.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>搖擺公雞</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>跪姿綿羊</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/756/2021-07-28_21.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/106/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>哼哧小豬</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>搖晃奶牛乳房</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/201/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/202/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>經典馬匹</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>吐唾沫羊駝</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/193/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/111/2021-07-22_12.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>靈動村民鼻</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>鐵傀儡靈動鼻</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/110/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/109/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>捲曲貓尾巴</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>飄逸豹貓尾巴</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/196/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/107/2021-07-22_12.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>活潑狗狗</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>動態雪人手臂</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/108/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/190/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>蜘蛛膝蓋</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>液態史萊姆</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/757/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/758/2021-07-28_09.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>揮舞手臂終界使者</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>搖晃苦力怕</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/374/725/2021-06-25_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/200/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>流暢烏賊觸手</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>類人生物膝蓋</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/374/728/2021-06-25_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/192/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>靈動鬼怪觸手</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>熔岩立方漢堡</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aQKmdRYwvGk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S3oko18JERQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>預告片由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEq5O5WCb2tTngspsMsyrrQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loook's</a> 製作</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7SktcUK2OPYQwe123rJVbg\" rel=\"nofollow\">JKapGaming</a> 提供</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BS0OOQJ5jQw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3I7i7oENjFI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyZA5Ysa33gA89sCdWJQojQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">CavemanFilms</a> 提供</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKlhpmbHGxBE6uw9B_uLeqQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sky Does Everything</a> 提供</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JGk4mXX6QQc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qkFSPBTdqXA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH-_hzb2ILSCo9ftVSnrCIQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">YOGSCAST Lewis &amp; Simon</a> 提供</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCshoKvlZGZ20rVgazZp5vnQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">CaptainSparklez</a> 提供</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SEqjHrJlYy4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4DYa_7KAdd8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS5Oz6CHmeoF7vSad0qqXfw\" rel=\"nofollow\">DanTDM</a> 提供</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>評測由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqg2eLFNUu3QN3dttNeOWkw\" rel=\"nofollow\">iHasCupquake</a> 提供</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Q：我該如何設定這個模組？</strong><br><strong>A：</strong>安裝我的<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a>模組，即可直接在遊戲內進行設定！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Q：這能與自訂資源包搭配使用嗎？</strong><br><strong>A：</strong>可以！「優質動畫合集」中的所有內容均基於原版資源建構，未使用任何額外貼圖。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 鳴謝：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">「優質動畫合集」的開發過程中，獲得了以下人士的帮助與啟發：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/KodaichiZero\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>KodaichiZero</strong></span></a> 基本上享有所有功勞，因為這些出色的模型與動畫是他多年前為 Minecraft 1.2.5 版開發原始<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1284100-1-2-5-the-better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Better Animations Collection</span></a>時的成果。繼續開發該專案的書面授權可於<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fD7CiEnf.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此處</span></a>查看。</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tr9zw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Tr9zw</strong></span></a> 其模組<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Not Enough Animations</span></a>啟發了物品檢視動畫的部分設計</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/almightytallestred\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Almightytallestred</strong></span></a> 其模組<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/player-eating-animation\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Player Eating Animation</span></a>啟發了進食動畫的部分設計</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/freshlx_official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>FreshLX</strong></span></a> 其資源包<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fresh Animations</span></a>啟發了豬耳朵飄動的設計</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fuser%252ftrayblock%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>TrayBlock</strong></span></a> 其附加元件<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fimproved-vanilla-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Improved Vanilla Mobs</span></a>啟發了雞喙修長的設計</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&message=LunaPixelStudios&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs_&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzss&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=u/Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=reddit&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs 0212&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/console-experience\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aXWOS7B.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTzDrbm.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
